{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>深水埗富昌邨富韻樓發生龜隻墮樓死亡案件。今早（17日）11時許，警方接獲屋苑保安報案，指發現有龜隻疑高處墮下。警員接報到場，發現龜隻已明顯死亡。警員調查後找到飼主，案件仍在調查中。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:26:51.221614+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:44:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:58.796438+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:21.275523+00:00","content_hash":"0cead00eee00b02e4090ba607bf298865cd0968387cc394e441f5b29bf8e3472","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}